      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / FACTORY 002\nGRANULAR VEIL\n\nTwo gently detuned analog VCOs feed a\nslow envelope and the Clouds processor.\n\nHold notes for a spacious evolving pad.\nTry changing Clouds SIZE, DENSITY,\nTEXTURE and BLEND. For long tones,\nplay one or two notes at a time.\n\nAuthor: MODULAR-SYNTH factory team\n",
